und the corner to keep going. Or a power when you need something big and you do not have a ability to do it your self. Like getting into a magically warded area. You might get captured and that how you get inside or the last person who went into the area didn't not reactive the wards. Now as a gm I wouldn't be a dick and put them in a impossible situation using this power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}